<title>USA: Summit says CFO Bhatt leaves for new job.</title>
<headline>Summit says CFO Bhatt leaves for new job.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summit Technology Inc said its executive vice president and chief financial officer, Rajiv Bhatt, has resigned to join another company.</p>
<p>Summit, a maker of ophthalmic laser systems, said it will launch a search for Bhatt's replacement. In the interim, Bhatt will serve as a consultant to the companay, it said.</p>
<p>It did not say which company Bhatt was joining.</p>
</text>
